  "fullText": "Now offering an off-site tuning session at cost to three selected teams in 2026. Apply Here\n\nSkip to Content\nOpen Menu\nMEET\nTHE TEAM\n\nWe’re coaches, facilitators, and systems thinkers. \n\nBut more than that, we’re a working unit, deeply attuned to each other and to the organizations we serve.\n\nCoaching is most effective when it’s systemic.\n\nOur Core team draws on combined experience in Psychotherapy, Gestalt theory, Somatics, Internal Family Systems, Trauma-Informed Coaching, and more to facilitate deep transformation in both individuals and systems.\n\nWe collaborate behind the scenes to share perspectives across an organization, reflect on dynamics, and bring aligned insight to your team so you get guidance that adapts as your organization evolves.\n\nWork With Us\n\nSandy Taylor, Certified Coach\n\nBrandon Houston, MA, LPC\n\nKatherine Folk-Sullivan, PCC\n\nDr. Kari Sulenes \n\nTogetherness that works\n\nWe facilitate the growth of individuals and groups to create high-functioning teams.\n\nGet Started\nNewsletter + Podcast\n\nWomens Retreat\n\nStories, insights, and new ideas from Heartwood. Get our monthly Newsletter, new podcast episodes and more by subsribing to Heartwood Collective on Substack. \n\nEvents\n\nVC Retreat\n\nFollow\n\nLinkedIn\n\nGet in touch\n\nhello@thehwc.com\n\nSubstack\n\nYoutube\n\nSelf-Transforming Teams\n\nHome\n\nThe Team\n\nFor Companies\n\nFor Investors\n\nTO TOP\n\nWe Respect your Privacy - Privacy Policy  | Data Processing Policy\n2025 Heartwood Collective, a part of Project Atlas LLC.\nCookie Preferences"
